 r←Test_Misc_21(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2
⍝ `codeCoverage`, `exec_before_each_test`, `exec_after_each_test` and custom messages can all be reset to ''
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 T2.codeCoverage←''
 T2.exec_before_each_test←''
 T2.exec_after_each_test←''
 T2.custom_1←''
 T2.custom_2←''
 →T.PassesIf(5⍴⊂'')≡T2.(codeCoverage exec_before_each_test exec_after_each_test custom_1 custom_2)

 r←T._OK
